   Output: pdb.agg_fn('AVG'::text)
   Index: cdc_json_int_idx
   Tantivy Query: {"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
     Applies to Aggregates: AVG(metadata.score)
     Aggregate Definition: {"0":{"avg":{"field":"metadata.score","missing":2.0}}}
(6 rows)

